/v/t64.5771-25/38974504_999332164037048_8352848161181583365_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FCkFx2F33VsQ7kNvwEiOstR&_nc_oc=AdpZ8g3SVNpwcRvRSiIQE5ybrQvXs8f06bxAT5sLazDPFIeF52463Tm1l3jcr3OmydY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTxJxz3tMIB8qJY0Xp3tsnNFWg_2ew3t0IM18y5jMH7Tg&oe=6AEC99F9"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom2.png", "id": "1060903411489141", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031501_1060903414822474_9192607785681237416_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zWT8PsSWtG8Q7kNvwGlsl-P&_nc_oc=AdoZPi-ZJx2DQwaB1xQe_OH2BmPI_nspjhApsphMeJXqDcyqlGZtUk3bkTXoDYcZAHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSuOJhpYBgHPYbPA0MEhQ42-w9nRtyeeeZIBDIihrNgfQ&oe=6AECAB83"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom3.png", "id": "1333559243720099", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_1333559247053432_5526570972152141129_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rWU57scddb4Q7kNvwEJ0HPl&_nc_oc=Adr1DK2ZCU7DE4el8YUzuGm5cl3D7JjgUmH3-7NwRVIIkahOq2Y0vPQ9hupAp9xAWK8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSF1Szl0UOSv61WPin_bjQnPXBPgTshlnoK0CUo5JAovQ&oe=6AECA24E"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom4.png", "id": "403819987828479", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982552_403819991161812_8720327022213224385_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WgpatJk4iagQ7kNvwG9Zd-_&_nc_oc=AdrZLxq6SjZADU_ihLWxxrmLeKcJ5Ad2tOsE17O-gqKSqMzfyBsQhkxTRU2IbMpmOfw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR1V_NX1Giab40jxSd4y6UeLCEi18RQBnREAwRkYtO5aw&oe=6AECAA73"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom5.png", "id": "397854095192936", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_397854098526269_4581865977018394136_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5z7xgHWk9wIQ7kNvwG0Y5CD&_nc_oc=Adqj-I_cPRNSqLVrCxjYeEYnXWeb9c8dNnvzqNcJO7_AErIqSCI-INJOIhk86cjh_ss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQbT6TZsyPw6WEsZUfSaWM5vNPNRW5SfmbeBzXmRv8U4g&oe=6AECA3BB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR-ME: Fire In The Engine Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the script of the scenario \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb after some welding work in the engine room, a fire starts in the bilge of the engine room, also spreading to the main electrical panel.The \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app includes actions mentioned below that are urgent at the situation of fire:\n\n-Go to the meeting point. Recount\n\n-Grab, carry and put on \ufb01re \ufb01ghter equipment, prove function     and adjustment\n\n-Grab one \ufb01re extinguisher and put it ready for use.\n\n-Going to the engine control room and trying to su\ufb00ocate the \ufb01re, with a \ufb01re  extinguisher.                          \n\nThe development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project.", "short_description": "\u00abVR-ME: Fire in the Engine Room\u00bb app is about an emergency situation when you\u2019re working onboard a vessel that is out to sea, an engine fire is one of the last things you want to deal with.Engine room fires also obviously put a ship filled with maritime workers at risk of injury or death. The development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project."}]}, "developer_name": "SQLearn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sqlearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "The consortium of the VR-ME project", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vr-me.eu/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating":